# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Personal deliberation state — the ENTIRE .consilium/ directory is local-only
# (runs, feedback journal, audit state, scratch bundles, screenshots). Ignore it
# wholesale except the single tracked placeholder, so no scratch file can leak
# via `git add -A`. Schema in docs/runs-schema.md.
.consilium/*
!.consilium/runs/
.consilium/runs/*
!.consilium/runs/.gitkeep
FEEDBACK.md
FEEDBACK.html
*.md.bak

# Claude Code session metadata (permissions, local settings)
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/skills/

# Local bug tracking / agent reports (anchored to repo root — an unanchored
# pattern silently swallowed docs/archive/bugs-agent-*.md, audit 2026-07-02).
# docs/archive/ agent reports stay local by explicit choice (personal notes,
# local paths) — the line below is deliberate, not a stray glob.
/BUGS.md
/bugs-agent-*.md
docs/archive/bugs-agent-*.md

# Local plans and experiments
# superpowers writing-plans / executing-plans artifacts — personal planning
# scratch (local absolute paths, insider detail); kept on disk, never published.
docs/superpowers/plans/
docs/superpowers/specs/
# TODO.md — internal dev roadmap / bug-audit records / deferred-item notes. Same
# class as the superpowers plans above: planning scratch with insider detail,
# kept on disk but not published. (History still contains it — full scrub is the
# separate clean-public-history task.)
TODO.md
.tmp_backup/

# Benchmark harness moved to its own repo (alxmax/Consilium-Benchmark). Ignore
# any leftover local benchmark/ tree (run artifacts, reports embedding answer
# values) so it can never be re-added here.
benchmark/

# Source upload for docs/architecture (extracted into docs/architecture/)
Arhitecture.zip

# Personal / scratch files — never publish. Broad class patterns so newly-named
# scratch can't slip in via `git add -A` (verified: no tracked file matches these).
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.ppt
tmp_*
*_tmp.*
scratch/
test_bundle.json
# Scratch deliberation bundles (bundle_smoke_tests.json kept — referenced by run-consilium)
bundle_high_priority.json
bundle_min.json
bundle_veto_op.json

# reqmap viewer: regenerated by every sync; docs/architecture/build.py copies it
# into docs/requirements-map.html, which is the committed, published copy
requirements/_map.html
